<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Steel year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Steel year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for Bangkok Steel Plc for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				    For 12 months</p>
<p>				   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.57	 2.55</p>
<p>    Net			 91.912    212.976</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter results not stated. Company's full name is Bangkok Steel Industry Plc, a steel producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
